    "text": "Tuscaloosa\nAlabama Learns SEC/ACC Challenge Opponent\nBy Wyatt Fulton,\n10 hours agoNate Oats and the Alabama men's basketball team have learned their opponent for the annual SEC/ACC non-conference matchups. It's the third year of the SEC/ACC Challenge between two of the premier conferences in college basketball. According to a post by Jon Rothstein on X, Alabama will host the Clemson Tigers...",
